{"type":"npc","name":"Plasma Lasher","folder":null,"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":220,"temp":0,"max":220,"details":""},"ac":{"value":34,"details":""},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":null,"otherSpeeds":[{"type":"fly","value":80}],"details":"swiftness"},"immunities":[{"type":"bleed","exceptions":[]},{"type":"electricity","exceptions":[]},{"type":"paralyzed","exceptions":[]},{"type":"poison","exceptions":[]},{"type":"sleep","exceptions":[]}],"resistances":[]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":["sussuran","talican","voltan"],"details":""},"level":{"value":13},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>Plasma lashers are born when a metallic core charged with primal energy naturally forms or is implanted within an air elemental. While many elementals are destroyed in this process, a handful remain intact, barely held together by magnetic forces. The elemental loses most of its previous shape and structure, but the remnants of its airy form provide an excellent medium for discharged electricity to run to the ground. The gases also provide protection for the core, acting as an inhospitable and whirling barrier against distant attacks.</p><p>This transformation often causes the elemental to lose their original sense of self. Plasma lashers are typically driven by two major impulses that often come into conflict. The first is a drive to explore far and wide, left over from their pasts, while the second is a desire to seek grounding. Plasma lashers are particularly intrigued by highly conductive metals. While silver is their favorite metal, they also enjoy copper and gold. Many plasma lashers collect a horde of precious metals for this purpose, which can make them targets for greedy adventurers. However, lashers value items based on their metal content rather than their artistic value, so canny traders can make quite a profit by exchanging large metal bars for smaller pieces of fine jewelry.</p><h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2><p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 375/840/1,560 gp</p><p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (bludgeoning, slashing), armor (light, medium, heavy), shield, perception item, skill items (Acrobatics, Intimidation, Nature)</p><p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> air, body, bane, charisma, dexterity, electricity, elongating, energy resistant (electricity, vitality), metal, poison, poisonous armor, sensory (darkvision), sturdy, wild, winged</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Elemental Storm (Pathfinder)","authors":"Reed Flietner","license":"ORC","remaster":true}},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":3},"dex":{"mod":8},"con":{"mod":4},"int":{"mod":2},"wis":{"mod":2},"cha":{"mod":5}},"perception":{"details":"","mod":22,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":23,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":27,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":19,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"acrobatics":{"base":27},"intimidation":{"base":24},"nature":{"base":21}},"traits":{"value":["air","electricity","elemental","metal"],"rarity":"uncommon","size":{"value":"huge"}}},"_id":"uQWWgf2d7AS9cp4t","img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/portraits/plasma-lasher.webp","prototypeToken":{"name":"Plasma Lasher","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"width":3,"height":3,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/tokens/plasma-lasher.webp","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"offsetX":0,"offsetY":0,"fit":"contain","scaleX":2,"scaleY":2,"rotation":0,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":[],"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":true,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":2,"texture":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/subjects/plasma-lasher.webp"}},"flags":{"pf2e":{"linkToActorSize":true,"autoscale":false}},"randomImg":false,"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null},"items":[{"type":"action","name":"Dispersed Form","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>Other creatures can occupy the same space as the plasma lasher. However, the gases in this space are not safe to breathe. A creature that ends its turn in the plasma lasher's space and does not hold its breath takes @Damage[2d6[poison],1d12[electricity]] damage and becomes @UUID[Compendium.battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e.effects.Item.1fZbuJEbVmE3J4XL].</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"RaXEzVEntlWVUIw7","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Metallic Core","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>A creature occupying the same space as the plasma lasher can attempt to target their metallic core with a melee Strike or spell attack roll. The plasma lasher gains a +2 circumstance bonus to AC against such attacks, but they lose their physical resistance, instead gaining gains weakness 10 to bludgeoning damage.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","option":"metallic-core","toggleable":true},{"key":"FlatModifier","selector":"ac","value":2,"type":"circumstance","predicate":["metallic-core"]},{"key":"Resistance","type":"physical","value":10,"predicate":[{"not":"metallic-core"}]},{"key":"Weakness","type":"bludgeoning","value":10,"predicate":["metallic-core"]}],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"4wKR7m6FWbbN2JIc","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Sudden Discharge","system":{"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature within the plasma lasher's reach uses a move action, or ends its turn occupying the same space as the plasma lasher</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> A jolt of plasma strikes the target creature, dealing @Damage[3d12[electricity]] damage (@Check[reflex|dc:32|basic] save). On a failed saving throw, the creature is @UUID[Compendium.battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e.effects.Item.1fZbuJEbVmE3J4XL] for 1 round.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["electricity","primal"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defen