{"value":"<p>A plasma arc forms between the plasma lasher's metallic core and a creature within 90 feet, dealing the creature @Damage[8d12[electricity]] damage (@Check[reflex|dc:32|basic] save). On a failed saving throw, the electrical connection persists and the target creature becomes @UUID[Compendium.battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e.effects.Item.1fZbuJEbVmE3J4XL] for 1 minute. The shocked condition automatically ends if the creature and the plasma lasher are ever more than 90 feet apart.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["electricity","primal"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"5wiHk35ldL93dPdZ","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Pulse Current","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The target creature is @UUID[Compendium.battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e.effects.Item.1fZbuJEbVmE3J4XL] from the plasma lasher's Conductive Connection</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> Current flow through the shocked creature, dealing @Damage[4d12[electricity]] damage (@Check[reflex|dc:32|basic] save).</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["electricity","primal"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"4WTCGk0lCSmztCs6","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":nu